    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Mullayanagiri in Chikkamagaluru district is frequently queried as Karnataka's highest peak.",
        "Talakaveri in the Brahmagiri Range (Kodagu) is the exact source of the Cauvery River.",
        "Malnad refers to the dense, hilly Western Ghats region, whereas Maidan denotes the eastern plain region."
      ],
      "id": "r0tbawa"
